teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.mp4?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b81ecbe552a7a9fc43897fa0aeac54cb.poster.avif?t=1763820210\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b81ecbe552a7a9fc43897fa0aeac54cb.webm?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b81ecbe552a7a9fc43897fa0aeac54cb.mp4?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/81cd4c6a55cc512907a9fd212fc73bc7.poster.avif?t=1763820210\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/81cd4c6a55cc512907a9fd212fc73bc7.webm?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/81cd4c6a55cc512907a9fd212fc73bc7.mp4?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d1082e849fb42d3b7e84cbe73ebebf30.poster.avif?t=1763820210\" width=800 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d1082e849fb42d3b7e84cbe73ebebf30.webm?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d1082e849fb42d3b7e84cbe73ebebf30.mp4?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.poster.avif?t=1763820210\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.webm?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.mp4?t=1763820210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DARK VENETIAN DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully hand-drawn pixel art world steeped in <strong>the elegance and unease of the Carnival of Venice</strong>. A haunting, original soundtrack inspired by <strong>Italian Baroque melodies</strong> enhances the atmosphere as you piece together <strong>a story of mystery, fate, and self-discovery</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" auto